messages.content:
Expand one assigned source event into one concise execution-target beat sentence for an 8-second video clip.

Preserve the assigned story event. For a broad ordinary activity, you MAY add the minimum mundane choreography needed to make the activity visibly complete and self-contained:
- include named beneficiaries/participants already implied by the event;
- choose ordinary props/details needed to show the activity;
- finish the local activity when practical before the next event;
- do not add unrelated actions, entrances/exits, hobbies, side conversations, new goals, or later plot events.

Return only one beat sentence.
